      "check": "reference ~ '^[0-9a-f]{32}$' AND octet_length(fingerprint) = 32 AND\ntransaction_id ~ '^[1-9][0-9]{0,19}$' AND\namount_minor > 0 AND currency = 'ZAR' AND\nallocation IN ('plan', 'assessment', 'excess')\n",
